Scenario: Add Multiple KB Article Suggestions
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article1 Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article1 Title|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article2 Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article2 Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle goto KB Article Via KB Display Hierarchy Navigation PG
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article1 Title|
	And KBArticleSuggestion add PG
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article1 Title|
		|kbSuggestionBody|Knowledge Base Article1 Suggestion1|
	And KBArticleSuggestion add PG
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article1 Title|
		|kbSuggestionBody|Knowledge Base Article1 Suggestion2|
	And KBArticleSuggestion add PG
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article1 Title|
		|kbSuggestionBody|Knowledge Base Article1 Suggestion3|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'There are 3 suggestions. (3 Pending)' at locator 'KnowledgeBase#LINK_THERE_ARE_SUGGESTIONS'
	And KBArticleSuggestion view PG
		|kbSuggestionBody|Knowledge Base Article1 Suggestion1|
		|kbSuggestionUserName|Test Test|
		|status|New|
	And KBArticleSuggestion view PG
		|kbSuggestionBody|Knowledge Base Article1 Suggestion2|
		|kbSuggestionUserName|Test Test|
		|status|New|
	Then KBArticleSuggestion view PG
		|kbSuggestionBody|Knowledge Base Article1 Suggestion3|
		|kbSuggestionUserName|Test Test|
		|status|New|
Scenario: Cancel Add Child Article
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle add Child PG Via KB Display
		|cancel|true|
		|kbArticleContent|Child Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Child Article Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle view PG
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'KnowledgeBase#HIERARCHY_NAVIGATION_CHILD'
Scenario: Cannot View Duplicate Breadcrumbs When Adding Parent Article
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content Parent|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title Parent|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content Child|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title Child|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle goto KB Article Via KB Display Hierarchy Navigation PG
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title Child|
	And KBArticle move Article Via KB Display PG
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title Child|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'KnowledgeBaseSelectParent#IFRAME'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'KnowledgeBaseSelectParent#BREADCRUMB_HOME'
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator '//ul[contains(@class,'breadcrumb')]//a[contains(.,'Home')]/following-sibling::ul[contains(@class,'breadcrumb')]'
