Scenario: View KB Article With Edited Star Ratings
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|PGKnowledgebasedisplay#ViewKBArticleWithEditedStarRatings|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle view Via KB Display PG
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And Navigator goto Nav Tab
		|navTab|Social|
	And Select the value 'Stars' at locator 'Select#KNOWLEDGE_BASE_RATING'
	And AssertClickNoError the value 'Save' at locator 'Button#SAVE'
	And Confirm the value 'Existing ratings data values will be adapted to match the new ratings type even though it may not be accurate. Do you want to continue?'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle rate Article 1 Star
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And KBArticle view Article 1 Star Rating PG
	And KBArticle rate Article From 1 Star To 5 Star
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	Then KBArticle view Article 5 Star Rating PG
